.TH ALI-PASSGEN 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ali-passgen \- passwords from Terry's Dice
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ali-passgen
.RI [ len ]
.br
.B ali-passgen \-\-words
.RI [ n ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints a 24-char (96-bit) random password by default.
.B \-\-words
prints 6 memorable words instead (logins only, never vault keys).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR terry-dice (1),
.BR ali-vault (1)
